    {
      "source": "Returns the domain class returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. In contrast to <a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>, this\nmethod extracts the type from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>s and <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> as well.",
      "translation": "返回由给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>所代表的域类。与<a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>不同，此方法还会从<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>和<a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>中提取类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the domain type information returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. In contrast to\n<a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>, this method extracts the type from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>s and\n<a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> as well.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 所返回的域类型信息。与\n<a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a> 不同，此方法还会从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> 中提取类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Common base class for <a href=\"RepositoryInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryInformation</code></a> that delays resolution of <a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> and the\nrepository base to the latest possible time.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RepositoryInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryInformation</code></a> 的通用基类，将 <a href=\"RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> 和仓库基类的解析延迟到尽可能晚的时间。",
      "count": 1
    },
