      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>of the domain type the repository is declared to manage.",
      "translation": "返回仓库声明为管理的域类型的<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the domain class returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回由给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>返回的域类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the domain type information returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
