      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> return type as it is declared in the repository.",
      "translation": "返回仓库中声明的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a> 方法的返回类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks whether the given method contains a custom store specific query annotation annotated with\n<a href=\"../../annotation/QueryAnnotation.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>QueryAnnotation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "检查给定的方法是否包含带有 <a href=\"../../annotation/QueryAnnotation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>QueryAnnotation</code></a> 的自定义存储特定查询注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> return type as it is declared in the repository. Considers suspended methods and\ndoes not unwrap component types but leaves those for further inspection.",
      "translation": "返回仓库中声明的类型 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 的返回类型。该方法会考虑挂起的（suspended）方法，并且不会解包组件类型，而是保留这些类型以供进一步检查。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>of the domain type the repository is declared to manage. Will never be\nnull.",
      "translation": "返回仓库声明为管理的域类型的<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks whether the given method contains a custom store specific query annotation annotated with\n<a href=\"../../annotation/QueryAnnotation.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>QueryAnnotation</code></a>. The method-hierarchy is also considered in the search for the annotation.",
      "translation": "检查给定的方法是否包含带有 <a href=\"../../annotation/QueryAnnotation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>QueryAnnotation</code></a> 的自定义存储特定查询注解。搜索该注解时也会考虑方法的层次结构。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the configured repository interface has custom methods, that might have to be delegated to a custom\nimplementation.",
      "translation": "如果配置的仓库接口包含可能需要委托给自定义实现的自定义方法，则返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the configured repository interface has custom methods, that might have to be delegated to a custom\nimplementation. This is used to verify repository configuration.",
      "translation": "如果配置的存储库接口包含自定义方法（这些方法可能需要委托给自定义实现），则返回 true。此功能用于验证存储库配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
